  "notes": "Kresus open-source finance manager. Each transaction row has a coloured right-edge stripe matching its category; income amounts are green, negatives bold grey; future/pending transactions get a diagonal-hatched background (first row). Bank logos as square thumbnails in the sidebar; selected account highlighted in solid #6792d8 with white text. Balance tile has a cyan icon block (scales icon) on the left. Content column is fixed ~770px leaving a blank area on the right at 1440px. Search filter panel and bulk-edit mode are hidden until toggled from the toolbar. Row '+' icon opens a separate transaction details page."
